  "Name": "Bludit Directory Traversal Image File Upload Vulnerability",
  "Description": "This module exploits a vulnerability in Bludit. A remote user could abuse the uuid parameter in the image upload feature in order to save a malicious payload anywhere onto the server, and then use a custom .htaccess file to bypass the file extension check to finally get remote code execution.",
